(a) whether Government has any proposals or sanctioned projects to promote and boost eco-tourism in the country, particularly through sustainable tourism initiatives;
(b) whether Government provides financial assistance to States and Union Territories for development of eco-tourism infrastructure;
(c) whether any special financial assistance has been provided to hilly States, particularly Himachal Pradesh, for promotion and development of eco-tourism;
(d) if so, the details thereof and the details of funds allocated and released during the last five years, State-wise; and
(e) the details of steps taken by Government to encourage community participation, sustainable livelihoods and environmentally responsible tourism in ecologically sensitive, hilly regions of the country?

(a) whether Government has implemented the National Action Plan on Forest Fire across all States and Union Territories;
(b) if so, the details of the implementation status, State/UT-wise;
(c) the details of financial assistance provided by the Central Government to States/UTs for forest fire prevention, disaster related mitigation during last five years, year-wise and State/UT-wise;
(d) whether any proposal for financial assistance from the State of Himachal Pradesh is pending with the Central Government ;
(e) if so, the reasons for delay; and
(f) the other measures taken by Government to strengthen early warning systems, fire fighting infrastructure and inter-agency coordination for effective prevention and management of forest fires?

