(a) district-wise details of claims regarding Individual Forest Rights (IFR), Community Rights (CR) and Community Forest Resource Rights (CFRR) in all States, including Himachal Pradesh;
(b) district-wise details indicating the claims relating to Individual Forest Rights (IFR) and Community Forest Resource Rights (CFRR) that are pending at the level of the Sub-Divisional Level Committee (SDLC) or the District Level Committee (DLC), if so, the number of such pending claims; and
(c) number of IFR, Community Forest Rights (CFR) and CFRR claims filed by pastoral communities up to latest available date, State-wise, and number of titles recognised in respect of such claims?

(a) whether Government has sanctioned a field survey for the preparation of a Detailed Project Report (DPR) for the conversion of the Pathankot–Jogindernagar (Kangra Valley) Railway line into broad gauge, if so, the details thereof;
(b) the present status of the survey, including the agency entrusted with the work and the expected date of its completion;
(c) whether Government proposes to take up the gauge conversion project in a phased manner after completion of the DPR;
(d) if so, the details thereof; and
(e) the estimated cost, proposed funding and the likely timeline for completion of the project?

(a) whether Government has provided assistance to the States affected by the excessive rainfall floods and landslides during the year of 2023-24, 2024-25 to till date;
(b) if so, the details thereof, State-wise, including Himachal Pradesh, Uttrakhand and Jammu and Kashmir;
(c) the total assistance provided to the States/UT under the SDRF/NDRF during the last three years;
(d) the steps taken by Government for deployment of NDRF teams during the current monsoon session for rescue and relief operation details of States specially in the State of Himachal Pradesh; and
(e) the measures being taken to enhance the preparedness, inter agency coordination and effective response both at National and State Level?

(a) the details of the objectives and features of the National Rail Plan;
(b) the details of the total estimated cost of implementing the plan and the funds allocated/utilized till date under it;
(c) the details of the progress made till date according to the plan; and 
(d) the steps taken by Government to increase the share of freight transport and its impact on economic growth and regional connectivity across the country including Himachal Pradesh?
